{"task_id": "HumanEval/88", "solution": "```python\ndef sort_array(array: list[int]) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns a sorted copy of an array of non-negative integers.\n    Sort order is ascending if the sum of the first and last elements is odd, and descending if even.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not array:\n        return []\n\n    if len(array) == 1:\n        return list(array)\n\n    arr_copy = list(array)  # Create a copy to avoid modifying the original array.\n\n    first_last_sum = array[0] + array[-1]\n\n    if first_last_sum % 2 != 0:  # Odd sum, sort ascending.\n        arr_copy.sort()\n    else:  # Even sum, sort descending.\n        arr_copy.sort(reverse=True)\n            \n    return arr_copy\n```"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/89", "solution": "```python\ndef encrypt(s):\n    \"\"\"Encrypts a string by rotating lowercase English letters by 4 positions.\n    Non-alphabetic characters are returned unchanged.\"\"\"\n    SHIFT_AMOUNT = 4\n    ALPHABET_SIZE = 26\n    result = []\n    for char in s:\n        if 'a' <= char <= 'z':\n            # Calculate the new position with wrapping for lowercase letters.\n            start_char_code = ord('a')\n            shifted_code = (ord(char) - start_char_code + SHIFT_AMOUNT) % ALPHABET_SIZE\n            result.append(chr(start_char_code + shifted_code))\n        else:\n            # Append non-lowercase alphabetic characters as they are.\n            result.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(result)\n```"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/89", "solution": "```python\ndef encrypt(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Encrypts a string by rotating alphabetic characters by a fixed shift value.\n    Non-alphabetic characters remain unchanged, and case is preserved.\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(s, str):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a string.\")\n\n    # Constants inlined to adhere to \"Return ONLY the bare function\"\n    SHIFT_VALUE = 4\n    ALPHABET_SIZE = 26\n    LOWERCASE_A_ORD = ord('a')\n    UPPERCASE_A_ORD = ord('A')\n\n    encrypted_chars = []\n    for char in s:\n        if 'a' <= char <= 'z':\n            shifted_ord = (ord(char) - LOWERCASE_A_ORD + SHIFT_VALUE) % ALPHABET_SIZE + LOWERCASE_A_ORD\n            encrypted_chars.append(chr(shifted_ord))\n        elif 'A' <= char <= 'Z':\n            shifted_ord = (ord(char) - UPPERCASE_A_ORD + SHIFT_VALUE) % ALPHABET_SIZE + UPPERCASE_A_ORD\n            encrypted_chars.append(chr(shifted_ord))\n        else:\n            encrypted_chars.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(encrypted_chars)\n```"}
