{"task_id": "HumanEval/103", "solution": "```python\ndef rounded_avg(n, m):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the average of integers from n through m (inclusive), rounds it using \"round half up\",\n    and converts to a binary string. Returns -1 if n > m.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n > m:\n        return -1\n\n    count = m - n + 1\n    sum_val = (count * (n + m)) // 2\n    \n    average_val = sum_val / count\n    \n    rounded_avg_val = int(average_val + 0.5)\n    \n    return bin(rounded_avg_val)\n```"}
