{"task_id": "HumanEval/128", "solution": "```python\ndef prod_signs(arr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of magnitudes multiplied by the product of signs.\n    Returns None for an empty array, handles zero values correctly.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not arr:\n        return None\n\n    def _get_sign(n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Determines the sign of an integer (1, -1, or 0).\"\"\"\n        if n > 0:\n            return 1\n        elif n < 0:\n            return -1\n        else:\n            return 0\n\n    def _get_magnitude(n: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Returns the absolute value (magnitude) of an integer.\"\"\"\n        return abs(n)\n\n    product_of_signs = 1\n    sum_of_magnitudes = 0\n\n    for num in arr:\n        product_of_signs *= _get_sign(num)\n        sum_of_magnitudes += _get_magnitude(num)\n    \n    return sum_of_magnitudes * product_of_signs\n```"}
